File: src/fit_field.cpp
Function: Field::GetNumSubFields
One decode of the test corpus takes about 358.509 ms.
The code below currently runs at 0.936688 of the original SDK's decode time; the best found so far is 0.936688.

Rewrite this function to make decoding faster:
```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumSubFields(void) const
{
    if ((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields))
        return 0;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].numSubFields;
}
